tamil-keyboard (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release, replacing the tamil-99-keyboard and
    tamil-phonetic-keyboard packages.
  * Ship tamil-keyboard-setup instead of configuring input sources from
    the postinst. Configuration is now user-initiated and session-local,
    so it works on Wayland and on non-GNOME desktops.
  * Add layouts alongside existing input sources rather than replacing
    them.

 -- Khaleel Jageer <jskcse4@gmail.com>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 07:00:00 +0530
